# UAV Post-Flight Backend — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **FastAPI backend** that implements the UAV Post-Flight Backend PRD v1. The backend transforms Pixhawk flight logs into structured mission JSON consumable by the frozen React dashboard.

## Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Pixhawk (ArduPilot)"] -->|MAVLink| B[MAVLink Client]
    B -->|DISARM event| C[Mission Worker]
    C -->|download| D[Log Downloader]
    D -->|.BIN file| E[BIN Parser]
    E -->|parsed data| F[Metrics Engine]
    F -->|metrics| G[JSON Builder]
    G -->|mission JSON| H["storage/missions/"]
    I[FastAPI API] -->|reads| H
    I -->|reads| J[State Manager]
    C -->|updates| J
    K[React Dashboard] -->|polls| I
```

